{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>והיה עקב</b> Above it is written היום לעשותם and adjacent to it is עקב — meaning: היום לעשותם, but their reward is בעקב, i.e., at the end. עק\"ב — there are this many words in the יו\"ד commandments of the first tablets, and this is בשמרם עקב רב: if you observe עקב, you will merit רב טובך אשר צפנת. עקב — make your Torah study קבע. עקב — learn humility from this עקב, which follows the foot in the way of humility, and therefore it is not stricken like the toes of the feet." "<b>המשפטים</b> — peh-alef doubled, that one must search and investigate the depth of the law. תשמעון ושמרתם ועשיתם — three, corresponding to מקרא, משנה, תלמוד. ושמר ה' אלהיך לך — if עקב תשמעון, He will keep for you the covenant, as stated regarding Abraham: עקב אשר שמע אברהם בקולי וישמור וגו'." "<b>ושמר</b> — in gematria: לעתיד לבא."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:09:05.700890229Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}